Management System
Initialization:
Set TOTAL_CAPACITY to maximum parking spaces.
Set available_slots = TOTAL_CAPACITY.
Set HOURLY_RATE to standard fixed rate per unit time (e.g., $5/hour).
Check Slot Availability (Before Entry):
If available_slots > 0, display "Parking Available: " + available_slots.
Else, display "Parking Full".
Vehicle Entry:
Input license_plate.
Capture current system time as entry_time.
Decrement available_slots by 1 (available_slots = available_slots - 1).
Store record: (license_plate, entry_time, status = "PARKED").
Vehicle Exit:
Input license_plate.
Search record matching license_plate where status == "PARKED".
Capture current system time as exit_time.
Calculate duration: \text{duration\_hours} = \lceil (\text{exit\_time} - \text{entry\_time}) \text{ in hours} \rceil.
Calculate fee: \text{total\_fee} = \text{duration\_hours} \times \text{HOURLY\_RATE}.
Display duration_hours and total_fee to driver.
Update record: (exit_time, total_fee, status = "COMPLETED").
Increment available_slots by 1 (available_slots)